  "key_observations_html": "<div style=\"border:1px solid #C7D8E8;border-radius:10px;padding:0.75rem 0.95rem;margin:0.1rem 0 0.55rem;background:#ffffff;box-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(15,23,42,0.06);\"><ul style=\"margin:0.1rem 0 0 1.05rem;padding:0;color:#1F4C67;font-size:0.9rem;line-height:1.45;\"><li><strong>Stablecoin market cap fell 5.3% over 30D:</strong> Stablecoin market cap at $275.80B (5.3% lower over 30D). Related: <a href=\"https://www.coindesk.com/business/2026/11/19/sky-s-usds-stablecoin-shrinks-35-as-usd1-5-billion-exits-reserves-after-illicit-finance-report\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Sky&#x27;s USDS stablecoin shrinks 35% as $1.5 billion exits reserves after illicit-finance report</a> (CoinDesk).</li><li><strong>Stablecoin market structure remains concentration-led:</strong> leadership is still defined by a small set of large issuers/platforms; share shifts matter as much as aggregate market-cap growth. Related: <a href=\"https://www.theblock.co/news/regulation/2026-11-18-senators-treasury-must-ensure-equal-footing-for-stablecoin-issuers-in-genius-act-implementation-443501\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Senators: Treasury must ensure \u2018equal footing\u2019 for stablecoin issuers in GENIUS Act implementation</a> (The Block).</li><li><strong>Bank rails are pushing stablecoins into treasury workflows:</strong> That pushes demand toward treasury and settlement use cases, not only exchange trading liquidity. Related: <a href=\"https://thedefiant.io/converge/tradfi-and-fintech/moonpay-seeks-us-trust-bank-for-custody-stablecoins\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">MoonPay Seeks US Trust Bank for Custody, Stablecoins</a> (The Defiant).</li></ul><p class=\"takeaways__note\">Context only\u2014not investment advice. Bullets combine on-page data with recent industry headlines.</p></div><p class=\"review-note ko-disclaimer\">Key observations are AI generated and should be reviewed for accuracy.</p>",
